> So what's the scoop? Has anyone with 3.1.3 gotten/not gotten Ludos Castle?

     The Ft.Ludios placement code works as intended, and it's true
that that level is not guaranteed to occur in every game.  However,
unlike the "bigroom" level, the chances of Ft.Ludios being left out
of any given game are quite small.

     The level number you saw was the depth/difficulty level assigned
to it at the start of the game, not the dungeon level where it's
entry portal will be located.  You could easily have a portal on 14
going to a level 19 Ft.Ludios, or a portal on 23 going to a level 18
Ft.Ludios (the latter is less likely).



